   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Clean vivid: median ~88, cool shadows (39,40,46), warm highlights (214,206,186), blue bin 34%, sky (89,110,142) sat 0.37, foliage sat 0.50, saturation 0.38. Best for: Flower fields, tulip and mustard fields, colourful villages, clean mountain lakes, bright destination frames with colourful decor. Clean and commercial.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
